      "id": "H4",
      "kind": "data_quality",
      "statement": "The apparent drop is due to missing or incomplete trip data for 2024-11-28 in the source system.",
      "support_if": "Trip count on 2024-11-28 is implausibly low (e.g., near zero) or daily row is missing; d_holiday in date_dim disagrees with us_holidays.",
      "refute_if": "Data for 2024-11-28 exists and appears complete; no data-quality flags."
    }
  ],
